{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15201040","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15201040","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1520104001:0":{"text":"Nice! The balls stick to a set path and won't stray off it. This area is safe.","source_cn":"果然。滚球只会沿着特定的路径滚动，不会冲到旁边的空地上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE98145C8849ACF84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520104002:0":{"text":"What's that?","source_cn":"那颗滚球是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3678F25637471B8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1520104003:1":{"text":"It's a mechanism triggered by the Wedge of Matter.","source_cn":"是物质之楔召唤的机关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA377866D4556B503","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520104004:0":{"text":"As Morgan suggested, we can use the safe spots along the path to dodge the rolling balls as we make our way to the sealing wedge.","source_cn":"如摩根所言，我们可以利用路径旁的安全区躲避滚球，前往封...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C7A514783884383","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1520104005:0":{"text":"Be careful.","source_cn":"多加小心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BBFB2AC6DF6B790","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","var